TITLE Notes on Penwright
INSERTTEXT Penwright
STYLE HEADING1
ALIGN CENTER
RETURN
INSERTTEXT A word processor for AmigaOS 4, written in Boing BASIC.
ALIGN CENTER
ITALIC ON
SELECT 1 0 1 55
ITALIC ON
