ALIGN LEFT
ITALIC OFF
INSERTTEXT What it does
STYLE HEADING2
RETURN
INSERTTEXT Penwright keeps your text in paragraphs with styles: headings, quotes, lists and code. Inside a paragraph every letter can be bold, italic, underlined, struck through or coloured, and the spelling checker marks words it does not know, like thsi one.
RETURN
INSERTTEXT Bold and colourful words
STYLE BULLET
RETURN
INSERTTEXT Find and replace, with case and whole words
RETURN
INSERTTEXT Export to RTF, HTML and plain text
RETURN
STYLE BODY
INSERTTEXT Good software, like good writing, is mostly rewriting.
STYLE QUOTE
SELECT 3 45 3 51
BOLD ON
SELECT 3 126 3 130
BOLD ON
SELECT 3 132 3 138
ITALIC ON
SELECT 3 140 3 150
UNDERLINE ON
SELECT 3 152 3 166
STRIKE ON
SELECT 3 170 3 178
COLOR 1
SELECT 3 188 3 204
COLOR 6
SELECT 4 0 4 4
BOLD ON
